DESCRIPTION:Join us for another great year atRicciRescues in the Park\, sp
 onsored by Ricci Law Firm Injury Lawyers! This free\, family-friendly even
 t features live entertainment\, activities for all ages\, pet adoptions\, 
 local vendors\, and more to enjoy.Stop by theSecond Chance Pet Adoptionste
 nt to meet our adorable adoptable dogs! You might just meet your new best 
 friend while learning more about the importance of rescue and giving anima
 ls a second chance.Learn more:
LOCATION:Midtown Park\, 4011 Cardinal at North Hills Street\, Raleigh
URL:https://secondchancenc.org/event/ricci-rescues-in-the-park/
