DESCRIPTION:Join us during our extended weekend hours for this special mon
 thly event\, Paws and Purrs Adoption Saturday! Our furry friends are here 
 and ready to meet you!Our center is located at 6003 Chapel Hill Road\, Sui
 te 133 in Raleigh\, NC 27607. We’ll be open for this event from 12pm to 
 3pm\, and we hope you’ll join us.
LOCATION:Second Chance Pet Adoptions\, 6003 Chapel Hill Road\, Suite 133\,
  Raleigh\, NC
